#: backyardchirps/features/notifications/logic.py:72
msgid "New species"
msgstr "Nueva especie"

#: backyardchirps/features/notifications/logic.py:98
msgid "First detection today"
msgstr "Primera detección hoy"

#: backyardchirps/features/notifications/logic.py:126
msgid "Rare species"
msgstr "Especie rara"

#: backyardchirps/features/notifications/logic.py:153
msgid "First of the year"
msgstr "Primera del año"

#: backyardchirps/features/notifications/logic.py:183
#, python-format
msgid "Not seen for %(days)s days"
msgstr "Sin detectar desde hace %(days)s días"

#: backyardchirps/features/notifications/logic.py:203
msgid "Dubious identification, pending human validation"
msgstr "Identificación dudosa, pendiente de validación humana"

#: backyardchirps/features/notifications/logic.py:309
msgid "Confidence"
msgstr "Confianza"

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/admin.html:4
msgid "Your account"
msgstr "Tu cuenta"

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/admin.html:9
msgid ""
"This station already has an account, and setup was never finished. Sign in "
"to carry on."
msgstr ""
"Esta estación ya tiene una cuenta y la configuración no llegó a terminar. "
"Inicia sesión para continuar."

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/admin.html:12
msgid "This account is how you will log in from now on."
msgstr "Con esta cuenta iniciarás sesión a partir de ahora."

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/admin.html:17
msgid "That token does not match the one on this machine."
msgstr "Ese token no coincide con el de esta máquina."

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/admin.html:18
msgid "That username and password did not match the account on this station."
msgstr ""
"Ese usuario y esa contraseña no coinciden con la cuenta de esta estación."

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/admin.html:19
msgid "Pick a username."
msgstr "Elige un usuario."

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/admin.html:20
msgid "That password is too easy to guess."
msgstr "Esa contraseña es demasiado fácil de adivinar."

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/admin.html:21
msgid "That did not work. Try again."
msgstr "No ha funcionado. Inténtalo otra vez."

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/admin.html:27
msgid "Setup token"
msgstr "Token de instalación"

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/admin.html:29
msgid "The installer printed this when it finished."
msgstr "El instalador lo mostró al terminar."

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/admin.html:34
msgid "Username"
msgstr "Usuario"

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/admin.html:39
msgid "Password"
msgstr "Contraseña"

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/admin.html:44
msgid "Sign in"
msgstr "Iniciar sesión"

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/admin.html:44
msgid "Create account"
msgstr "Crear cuenta"

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/base.html:6
#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/base.html:13
msgid "Set up your station"
msgstr "Configura tu estación"

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/base.html:15
#, python-format
msgid "Step %(step_number)s of %(step_total)s"
msgstr "Paso %(step_number)s de %(step_total)s"

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/base.html:27
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Atrás"

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/base.html:29
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Siguiente"

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/done.html:4
msgid "Ready"
msgstr "Listo"

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/done.html:9
msgid ""
"Setup is finished, but the recorder did not start. Check the server status "
"page."
msgstr ""
"La configuración ha terminado, pero el grabador no ha arrancado. Mira la "
"página de estado del servidor."

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/done.html:11
msgid "Go to the site"
msgstr "Ir al sitio"

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/done.html:13
msgid "The station could not finish setting up. Try again."
msgstr ""
"La estación no ha podido terminar la configuración. Inténtalo otra vez."

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/done.html:16
msgid ""
"That is everything. Finishing starts the recorder and puts the setup token "
"beyond use, so this wizard will not open again."
msgstr ""
"Ya está todo. Al terminar arranca el grabador y el token de instalación deja "
"de servir, así que este asistente no volverá a abrirse."

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/done.html:30
msgid "The region pack is still downloading. Finishing does not stop it."
msgstr "El paquete de región sigue descargándose. Terminar aquí no lo detiene."

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/done.html:32
msgid "The region pack is installed."
msgstr "El paquete de región está instalado."

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/done.html:34
msgid ""
"The region pack could not be downloaded. The settings page can try again."
msgstr ""
"El paquete de región no se ha podido descargar. Puedes volver a intentarlo "
"desde la página de ajustes."

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/done.html:41
msgid "Finish"
msgstr "Terminar"

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/language.html:4
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Idioma"

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/language.html:7
msgid ""
"Which language should this wizard use? You can change the site language "
"later."
msgstr ""
"¿En qué idioma quieres este asistente? El idioma del sitio se puede cambiar "
"después."

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/location.html:4
msgid "Where the station is"
msgstr "Dónde está la estación"

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/location.html:12
msgid ""
"The coordinates decide which species can be here at all, so nothing works "
"well without them. Click the map, or type them in."
msgstr ""
"Las coordenadas deciden qué especies pueden estar aquí, así que nada "
"funciona bien sin ellas. Haz clic en el mapa, o escríbelas."

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/location.html:24
msgid "Make the map bigger"
msgstr "Agrandar el mapa"

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/location.html:29
msgid "Make the map smaller"
msgstr "Reducir el mapa"

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/location.html:34
msgid "Zoom in"
msgstr "Acercar"

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/location.html:35
msgid "Zoom out"
msgstr "Alejar"

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/location.html:42
msgid ""
"The map needs an internet connection. The coordinates below work without it."
msgstr ""
"El mapa necesita conexión a internet. Las coordenadas de abajo funcionan sin "
"ella."

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/location.html:52
msgid "Latitude"
msgstr "Latitud"

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/location.html:54
msgid "That is not a latitude between -90 and 90."
msgstr "Eso no es una latitud entre -90 y 90."

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/location.html:58
msgid "Longitude"
msgstr "Longitud"

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/location.html:60
msgid "That is not a longitude between -180 and 180."
msgstr "Eso no es una longitud entre -180 y 180."

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/location.html:64
msgid "Use my location"
msgstr "Usar mi ubicación"

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/microphone.html:4
msgid "Microphone"
msgstr "Micrófono"

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/microphone.html:7
msgid "Pick the input to record from. The meter moves when it hears you."
msgstr ""
"Elige la entrada desde la que grabar. El medidor se mueve cuando te oye."

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/microphone.html:15
msgid "default"
msgstr "por defecto"

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/microphone.html:27
msgid "The microphone is in use by something else."
msgstr "Otro programa está usando el micrófono."

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/microphone.html:30
msgid "That device could not be opened."
msgstr "No se ha podido abrir ese dispositivo."

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/microphone.html:33
msgid "That is loud enough to distort. Turn the microphone gain down."
msgstr "Suena tan alto que se distorsiona. Baja la ganancia del micrófono."

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/microphone.html:37
msgid ""
"This machine has no recording device, so there is nothing to listen with."
msgstr ""
"Esta máquina no tiene ningún dispositivo de grabación, así que no hay con "
"qué escuchar."

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/region-pack.html:4
msgid "Region pack"
msgstr "Paquete de región"

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/region-pack.html:10
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your station is inside %(region_pack_name)s. Its region pack holds the "
"seasonal charts, the range maps and the reference recordings for the "
"%(region_pack_species_count)s species that live there."
msgstr ""
"Tu estación está dentro de %(region_pack_name)s. Su paquete de región tiene "
"los gráficos de temporada, los mapas de distribución y las grabaciones de "
"referencia de las %(region_pack_species_count)s especies que viven allí."

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/region-pack.html:14
#, python-format
msgid ""
"No region pack covers where you are. The nearest is %(region_pack_name)s, "
"about %(region_pack_distance_km)s km away."
msgstr ""
"Ningún paquete de región cubre donde estás. El más cercano es "
"%(region_pack_name)s, a unos %(region_pack_distance_km)s km."

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/region-pack.html:17
msgid ""
"Take it anyway, or carry on without one. Without a region pack the site "
"works, but a species page shows no seasonal chart and no range map."
msgstr ""
"Puedes descargarlo igualmente, o seguir sin ninguno. Sin paquete de región la "
"web funciona, pero la página de una especie no muestra gráfico de temporada "
"ni mapa de distribución."

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/region-pack.html:20
msgid "Ask for a region pack that covers you"
msgstr "Pide un paquete de región que te cubra"

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/region-pack.html:25
msgid "Pack"
msgstr "Paquete"

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/region-pack.html:29
#, python-format
msgid "%(name)s (%(species)s species, %(megabytes)s MB)"
msgstr "%(name)s (%(species)s especies, %(megabytes)s MB)"

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/region-pack.html:33
msgid ""
"The download starts when you press Next and carries on while you finish "
"setting up."
msgstr ""
"La descarga empieza al pulsar Siguiente y continúa mientras terminas la "
"configuración."

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/region-pack.html:36
msgid ""
"The list of region packs could not be reached, so there is nothing to offer "
"yet."
msgstr ""
"No se ha podido acceder a la lista de paquetes de región, así que todavía no "
"hay nada que ofrecer."

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/region-pack.html:37
msgid ""
"This needs the internet. You can add a region pack later from the settings "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Esto necesita internet. Puedes añadir un paquete de región más tarde desde "
"la página de ajustes."

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/region-pack.html:39
msgid ""
"Go back and set the location first, so this step knows which region pack to "
"offer."
msgstr ""
"Vuelve atrás y pon la ubicación primero, para que este paso sepa qué paquete "
"de región ofrecer."

#: backyardchirps/templates/setup/region-pack.html:41
msgid "There are no region packs yet."
msgstr "Todavía no hay paquetes de región."
